## 5. Retryable Ticket Ordering (Arbitrum)

```solidity
// VULNERABLE - assumes sequential execution
function sendL2Messages() external {
    // Message A: Claim rewards
    inbox.createRetryableTicket(..., abi.encodeCall(l2.claimRewards, (user)));
    
    // Message B: Unstake (depends on A)
    inbox.createRetryableTicket(..., abi.encodeCall(l2.unstake, (user)));
    
    // If B executes before A, rewards lost!
}

// SECURE - combine into single message or atomic operation
function sendL2Messages() external {
    inbox.createRetryableTicket(
        ..., 
        abi.encodeCall(l2.claimAndUnstake, (user))  // Single atomic operation
    );
}
```

