## Cross-Chain Audit Checklist

- [ ] Messages include chain ID and validated
- [ ] Message nonces/hashes tracked to prevent replay
- [ ] Multisig or threshold for relayer signatures
- [ ] No signature malleability issues
- [ ] L2 sequencer uptime checked (Arbitrum/Optimism)
- [ ] Message ordering dependencies handled
- [ ] Bridge liquidity protected with rate limits
- [ ] Merkle proofs properly constructed
- [ ] Emergency pause available
- [ ] Timelock on critical bridge parameters
